                    "note": "*“A creature that **ends its turn** in it”* — the creature's own turn end, which pf2e's `Aura` rule element does not time. It shipped as a `turn-end` rider with a 10-foot area, which fires on the **Quincy's** turn end and fans out from there: a different ability, and one that pays out even when nobody has stood in the current. `Sources.onAuraTurn` drives this shape from the encounter."
