                    "predicate": [
                        "item:tag:soulbound-spirit-weapon"
                    ],
                    "oncePerRound": true,
                    "note": "*“Once per round when you hit with your spirit weapon, arcs jump: **one other creature** within 15 feet of the target”* — one, chosen, and measured from the creature struck rather than from the Quincy. It shipped as a `prompt`: a card telling the GM the numbers and applying none of them. An area would catch everybody within 15 feet, which is a different and much better ability, so this is a `pick` with `from: \"target\"`."
